              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "el resfriado — \"the cold (illness)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Tengo un resfriado fuerte. I have a bad cold."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In Spain also el catarro; in parts of South America el resfrío."
            }
          ]
        },
