              "text": "constipado — \"having a cold, bunged up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Estoy constipado y no puedo respirar bien. I have a cold and cannot breathe properly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A false friend, mainly in Spain: estar constipado is to have a cold. Constipated is estreñido."
            }
          ]
