              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "No quiero contagiarte el resfriado. I do not want to give you my cold."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Contagiarse — to catch something. It is also used for feelings: contagia su alegría."
            }
          ]
        },
