          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "contagiar is built on contagio, usually described as a learned borrowing from Latin contāgium \"contact, infection\", from tangere \"to touch\"."
            }
          ]
        },
